[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:The Future]
[00:11.46]Does what Madam Bellinsky said come true?
[00:17.39]At a village fair, I decided to visit a fortune-teller called Madam Bellinsky.
[00:24.71]I went into her tent and she told me to sit down.
[00:29.51]After I had given her some money, she looked into a crystal ball and said:
[00:36.06]'A relation of yours is coming to see you.
[00:40.28]She will be arriving this evening and intends to stay for a few days.
[00:46.94]The moment you leave this tent, you will get a big surprise.
[00:52.51]A woman you know well will rush towards you.
[00:56.71]She will speak to you and then she will lead you away from this place. That is all.'
[01:06.26]As soon as I went outside, I forgot all about Madam Bellinsky because my wife hurried towards me.
[01:14.25]'Where have you been hiding?' she asked impatiently.
[01:18.79]'Your sister will be here in less than an hour and we must be at the station to meet her. We are late already.'
[01:27.32]As she walked away, I followed her out of the fair.
